      "caption": "And honestly? You don't need to wait until January to start. Save this workout and do it 4× a week using light weights. I am using 2kg each dumbbell 👌  You don't need hours in the gym. You need consistency. And if you combine your workouts with simple nutrition habits, you can make even more progress by Christmas. 🥩 Include protein at every meal — eggs, Greek yogurt, cottage cheese, chicken, fish, lean meat, beans or tofu. 🥦 Fill half your plate with vegetables whenever you can. 🍓 Choose whole foods most of the time and keep highly processed snacks as occasional foods rather than everyday staples. 💧 Drink enough water — thirst can sometimes feel like hunger. Aim for 4 workouts a week + better food choices + consistency. Let's see what your body can do by Christmas. ❤️ SAVE this workout and comment 🎄 if you're starting today! #fullbodyworkout #homeworkouts #burnfat #weightlosss #womenover40 ",
