      "caption": "A big part of losing weight is finally realizing nobody else is walking in your shoes, carrying your history, or starting from your exact page. For a long time it was easy to measure my progress against someone else’s timeline, someone else’s resources, or a highlight reel that didn’t show the messy middle—and none of that ever moved me forward. My pace is mine, my starting point was valid, and every pound down came with a whole lot of self-respect I didn’t used to have. I’m not racing anybody anymore; I’m just proud of who I’m becoming and falling in love with the woman doing the work. 💖 #capcut #losingweight #cominghome #weightloss #findyourself ",
